    "data": {
      "text": "Ginkgo is a high-performance numerical linear algebra library for many-core systems, with a focus on solution of sparse linear systems. It is implemented using modern C++ (you will need an at least C++17 compliant compiler to build it), with GPU kernels implemented for NVIDIA, AMD and Intel GPUs.\n\n[Prerequisites] #prerequisites | [Building Ginkgo] #building-and-installing-ginkgo | [Tests, Examples, Benchmarks] #tests-examples-and-benchmarks | [Bug reports] #bug-reports-and-support | [Licensing] #licensing | [Contributing] #contributing-to-ginkgo | [Citing] #citing-ginkgo",
